 "remarks": "Luxury Living At The Biltmore! Own This Beautiful 1-Bedroom Residence In The Heart Of Downtown Stamford, Featuring Wood Floors, Freshly Painted Designer-Color, And A Kitchen With Newer LG, Bosch, And GE Appliances. Enjoy Lovely Sunset City Views And 24/7 Concierge Service, State-Of-The-Art Fitness Center, Resident Lounge, And A Beautiful 4th-Floor Courtyard. Located Across From Stamford Town Center With Shopping, Dining, Entertainment, And Pickleball America. Fine Dining, Theaters, Library, Banks, And The Stamford Train Station-Less Than A Mile Away-Are All Nearby. Pet-Friendly (Size Restrictions) And Rentals Permitted With A 60-Day Minimum. Parking is separate: rent a space in the attached garage for approximately $120/month.  (Biltmore Hallway Renovation In Progress Fall 2026!). Washer/Dryer Install Allowed Per Bylaws. A Wonderful Opportunity To Own Downtown Luxury! Schedule Your Private Tour Today!",
